# CLAUDE.local.md — security boundary (copy to CLAUDE.local.md; git-ignored; never committed)

## Servers
No servers yet. Fill in when the rehearsal server exists.

## Read-only commands (run freely)
- git status / log / diff, ls, cat of non-secret files, php artisan route:list, php artisan config:show <key>, tail of application logs

## State-changing commands (per-command "yes" from Rizwan)
- php artisan migrate (rehearsal only), queue restarts, cache clears on rehearsal

## Never-list (absolute)
- Display or copy .env, tokens, API keys, recovery codes, TOTP seeds
- Interactive shells, sudo, key changes
- Seeding or resetting production, migrate:fresh anywhere but local
- Rollbacks, raw SQL on production, deletes
- composer setup or any destructive reset
